OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland in rescue talks as
OL,4,Aowners seek buyer
OL,5,
OL,6,FRetail chain Poundland is in talks with
OL,7,Fpotential buyers as it seeks a rescue
OL,8,Fdeal, it has confirmed.
OL,10,FExecutives are working with an Irish
OL,11,Fproperty development group on a
OL,12,Fmanagement buyout, as first reported by
OL,13,FSky News.
OL,15,FBut a union representing shopworkers
OL,16,Fwarned that the retailer could fall
OL,17,Finto administration if that deal falls
OL,18,Fthrough, putting thousands of jobs at
OL,19,Frisk.
OL,21,FThis outcome would be "a disaster for
OL,22,Four members", the Usdaw union said.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
